FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: the-procession.
FILED BY: the moving party, who has been told the file is moving and would like to see it move.

OFF THE RECORD: The gallery's small demonstration. K moves one place per
OFF THE RECORD: court day. The picture is intentionally plain enough to read
OFF THE RECORD: at a glance: a frame number, a twelve-place track, a direction,
OFF THE RECORD: and the durable position held in the case's records.
OFF THE RECORD:
OFF THE RECORD: With no summonses waiting, AWAIT SUMMONS FOR AT MOST 1 DAY is
OFF THE RECORD: the clock: one frame appears each second. A summons advances
OFF THE RECORD: the next frame immediately, which lets the deposition test the
OFF THE RECORD: whole animation without making CI watch the clock. Serve q at
OFF THE RECORD: any time to adjourn early.
OFF THE RECORD:
OFF THE RECORD: Stop the Court between any two frames and convene it again.
OFF THE RECORD: The frame, position, direction, timer, and program counter are
OFF THE RECORD: already in the log. K resumes from the same place because the
OFF THE RECORD: animation is not state held by the process; it is the case file.

ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT tracks IS A SCHEDULE COMPRISING
        "[K...........]" AND
        "[.K..........]" AND
        "[..K.........]" AND
        "[...K........]" AND
        "[....K.......]" AND
        "[.....K......]" AND
        "[......K.....]" AND
        "[.......K....]" AND
        "[........K...]" AND
        "[.........K..]" AND
        "[..........K.]" AND
        "[...........K]".
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT frame IS 0.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT position IS 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT step IS 1.

ARTICLE 2.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT frame IS frame PLUS 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT direction IS "east -->".
    SHOULD step EQUAL -1, LET IT BE RECORDED THAT direction IS "<-- west".
    PROCLAIM "TRIALLANG // A LIVE CASE\nframe " PLUS (THE TRANSCRIPT OF frame)
        PLUS " of 23\n" PLUS (THE ITEM AT position IN tracks)
        PLUS "\ndirection: " PLUS direction PLUS " | durable position: "
        PLUS (THE TRANSCRIPT OF position)
        PLUS "\nstop the Court; restart it; K resumes from this frame".
    SHOULD frame FAIL TO FALL SHORT OF 23, REFER TO ARTICLE 5.

ARTICLE 3.
    AWAIT SUMMONS FOR AT MOST 1 DAY, FILED UNDER tick. FAILING WHICH, REFER TO ARTICLE 4.
    SHOULD tick EQUAL "q", REFER TO ARTICLE 5.

ARTICLE 4.
    SHOULD position EQUAL 12, LET IT BE RECORDED THAT step IS -1.
    SHOULD position EQUAL 1, LET IT BE RECORDED THAT step IS 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT position IS position PLUS step.
    REFER TO ARTICLE 2.

ARTICLE 5.
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.
